window.products.push({"id":289132,"name":"Yourtablecloth Ribbed Cotton Placemats – Placemat with Thicker Construction – Heavy Duty, Eco Friendly & Elegant Large Placemats –Set of 6 –Be it Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y8OKPYUrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENHANCE DINNING EXPERIENCE – Give an edge to your ordinary/old table, and add an element of interest, charm & appeal using YourTableCloth cotton placemats which are made up of 100% five ply cotton, also protecting your furniture from heat, stains and scratches. Each mat has sufficient space/size to let you put plates, spoons, knives and glasses for drinks. Come in a set of 6 cotton placemats in each pack, and are available in solid wine, red and black colors. ECO FRIENDLY DINNING ESSENTIAL – Having a meal on classy and elegant placemats (cotton) can definitely enhance dining experience of anyone – made up of 100% cotton, our placemats are totally eco friendly, give you a guilt free tablescape, and let you do your bit for the environment – embrace a modern yet classy lifestyle about which many people fancy – also lets you be the inspiration for people around. WORRY FREE MAINTENANCE – The best thing about our ribbed cotton placemats is that they require minimum maintenance. Find them dirty, just put them in the washing machine and lay flat to dry them. These easy to clean mats are durable & long lasting, and even dry very quickly as well. They roll up easily for storage. You can free fold them and there will be no deformation/distortion or permanent folding marks as is the case with plastic & PVC – you can expect some wrinkles though. MULTIPURPOSE – Professionally stitched large cotton placemats have a high quality ribbed material which makes them anti skid along with giving them an elegant and premium appearance. These mats can be used for table décor at home, cafes or restaurants; even bedside tables, vanity room tables, serving trays or even for dressers. They are ideal for everyday use. GIFT WITH GUARANTEE – Perfect gifting cotton placemat set for house warming parties, Christmas, Thanksgiving or any other such occasions – people who love to throw parties will love to own them. These mats’ low maintenance & eco-friendly features make them ideal for any formal or causal dinner setting, get togethers, holidays, picnics, parties, potlucks, brunches, barbecues, buffets, showers or any indoor-outdoor needs. We also offer 100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y8OKPYUrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yourtablecloth","source_asin":"B07H514H24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H514H24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H514H24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
