window.products.push({"id":289240,"name":"Gevi Electric Griddle, 7-in-1 Electric Grill Air Fryer Combo, 2 Nonstick Plates, Stainless Steel Electric Griddle with Temperature Control, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710-X269qKL._AC_SL1370_.jpg","description":"【THICKNESS MEASUREMENT - SMART TO GRILL】: With our patent of thickness measurement technology, Gevi electric contact grill can automatically adjust to the right temperature for the size and thickness(10cm-50cm) of any food type. Cooking beginners can also grill easily, no need to worry about the food getting burnt. 【6 AUTOMATIC COOKING PRESETS】: This electric indoor grill has 6 automatic cooking programs for Burger, Poultry, Sandwich, Sausage, Red Meat, and Fish. Only a turn of the knob to select the menu, you can enjoy the delicious food at home with ease. 【OPEN FLAT - LARGE GRILLING SURFACE】: The 2-in-1 Gevi indoor electric grill has 2 cooking plates, a griddle on one side and a grill on the other. It can be used as a contact grill with smart function, or be used as a simple electric griddle in 180 degrees open flat. The griddle has a large grilling surface and can meet your family’s needs. You can cook different kinds of food on different cooking plates with different forms of use. 【COOKING PROGRESS REMINDER】: Indicator light and audible beeps for rare, medium and well done make it easy to monitor the cooking progress. After selecting the preset menu and pressing \"OK\", the contact grill starts to preheat for minutes, and then you put the meat/vegetable in the machine. After that, the contact grill will have a beeping reminder when the food is \"Well Done\". For the \"Red Meat\" preset, it will beep at “Rare”, “Medium” and “Well Done” during the cooking. 【EASY TO CLEAN】: The Gevi smokeless electric grill is equipped with the nonstick plates and drip tray, which are removable for easy, dishwasher-safe cleaning. This indoor grill is more convenient to collect food residue and does not need to be replaced frequently. Gevi Electric Griddle with a non-stick surface also means very little oil needs to be used","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710-X269qKL._AC_SL1370_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gevi","source_asin":"B09M2QY2X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M2QY2X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M2QY2X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
