window.products.push({"id":289300,"name":"Secura Digital Air Fryer 1700W Electric Hot Air Fryers XL 5.3Qt / 5.0L LCD Screen | 60 Min Timer & Auto Shut Off, Half Time Shaking Reminder | Bonus B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tCSnI29GL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LESS FAT & HEALTHIER - Oil less than traditional fryers. Secura air fryers allow you to fry, bake, grill, and roast with little to no oil. Make crispy fried chicken, steak, French fries, pizza, and much more in one countertop appliance without adding any oil. Enjoy your favorite food without the extra calories! MULTIFUNCTIONAL COOKER - All in one digital air fryer equivalent to oven, fryer, microwave, grill, sandwich maker, nonstick frying pan, and popcorn maker. Use our recipes to easily fry, bake, and grill all your favorite foods with one cooking device. EASY TO OPERATE - Large and easy-to-read screen controls let you set precise temperatures and cook times, while the 8 programmed cooking modes save you the guesswork of preparing your favorite meals. A helpful half time shaking reminder lets you know when to shake the contents for an even fry. USER FRIENDLY - Accessories included with the Digital Air Fryer for extra versatility recipes in user manual, grill rack & skewers. Quick and easy cleanup. Extra Large 5. 3Qt / 5. 0L easily lets you prepare healthy and delicious food with ease for whole family. 2-YEAR - Comes with 1 × fryer basket, 1 × fryer pan. Bonus 1 × BBQ grilling rack, 4 × skewers, and the user manual contains recipes. Cleanup is a breeze. 2 years is reliable! Only for use with North American Electrical Standards, 120V/1700W.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tCSnI29GL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Secura","source_asin":"B07HQMK8C5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HQMK8C5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HQMK8C5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289301,"name":"Elrene Home Fashions Poinsettia Elegance Jacquard Holiday Tablecloth, 60\" x 102\" Oblong/Rectangle, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x9TU0oIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Poinsettia Elegance Jacquard Holiday table-linen collection brings holiday-inspired beauty and class to your table with its delicately woven and patterned design. Each separately sold piece, from the napkins to the placemats to the table runner to the tablecloth, will dress up your holiday meals. Whether you’re celebrating a large family gathering or setting the scene for a quiet Christmas dinner, these linens will make your table beautiful.Each piece in this collection features a classic pattern and hemmed edge to create a finished look while helping to prevent wear and tear. The napkins and dinner placemats will make simple plates pop with eye-catching colors, and the tablecloth is available in multiple sizes to fit oval, square, rectangular, and round tables. Add the table runner as the finishing touch to a perfect holiday table, or mix and match the colors to suit your ideal seasonal decor.With Elrene Home Fashions decor and accessories, you always get functional style. Made of durable 100% polyester, these pieces are all machine washable, so care is easy when you need to refresh them in a pinch. The fabric repels water and stains and can be ironed to keep it wrinkle-free.Each napkin measures 17\" x 17\", and each placemat measures 13\" x 19\". The tablecloth is available in the following sizes: 52\" x 52\" (square), 60\" x 84\" (oval), 52\" x 70\" (rectangle), 60\" x 84\" (oblong), 60\" x 102\" (oblong), 60\" x 120\" (oblong), 60\" x 144\" (oblong), 70\" (round), and 90\" (round). The table runner measures 13\" x 70\". Each napkin set, placemat set, table runner, and tablecloth is sold separately.Elrene Home Fashions is a trusted international lifestyle brand that values and stands for timeless elegance, innovative design, and outstanding quality. We are 100% committed to our customers and strive to give the very best in all of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x9TU0oIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elrene Home Fashions","source_asin":"B08RQCHW9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RQCHW9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RQCHW9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
