window.products.push({"id":289345,"name":"UKRPOSHTA Fridge Magnet Good Evening, We are from Ukraine Ukraine Stamp, W, Original Product (Polyceramic, 73x54 mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XbgvYsCpL._AC_SL1007_.jpg","description":"The greeting ''Good evening, we are from Ukraine!'' became iconic in 2022 after the Russian military invasion of Ukraine. Journalists, officials and the military start their speeches with this phrase, and musicians include it in their tracks. The Ukrainian people selected the phrase ''Good evening, we are from Ukraine!'' from among the five topics of the next Ukrainian wartime postage stamp. According to the author of this postal edition, Anastasiia Bondarets, her drawing is about every Ukrainian doing everything they can, depending on their capabilities, to bring the Victory closer. Magnet featuring the image of the popular postage stamp ''Good Evening, We Are From Ukraine!'', face value W. The MDF magnet is produced from high-quality 3mm fibreboard, with the image applied by a UV printer. The polyceramic magnet is produced from a unique composite called polyceramics. The image is detailed and vivid. Paint does not wear off and does not fade in the sun. Product details: Magnet: 0.9mm magnetic polymer Packaging: polypropylene bag Image application: UV printing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XbgvYsCpL._AC_SL1007_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UKRPOSHTA","source_asin":"B0B7SKCY1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7SKCY1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7SKCY1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289346,"name":"Marquis by Waterford Polka Dot 3-Piece Stainless-Steel Bar Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41A9PTVXK8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A cosmopolitan should be shaken and served with style. Here are the accessories to do it right: this vintage-style barware gift set from Waterford Marquis. Made of durable stainless steel, the set is sophisticated yet has an element of fun, with a 1950s retro look and a dot pattern hammered into the metal. Includes a 13-3/4\" round tray; 8H\" cocktail shaker, and 7H\" ice pail with lid. Perfect for someone who knows his martinis from his Manhattans, and an excellent gift for a groom's attendants. Amazon.com The Vintage collection from Marquis by Waterford celebrates the look of earlier eras with a modern sensibility. Those who like cool sophistication will dig Vintage stainless-steel barware and crystal stemware. This three-piece set for the home bartender includes a cocktail shaker, ice bucket, and serving tray, all crafted of premium stainless steel that juxtaposes a polished and satin finish. Eye-catching concave polka dots add a party-time touch to the shaker and bucket, which feature lids with rounded shoulders and wide, flat knobs. A handle on the bucket swings up to allow for easy carrying. The tray, measuring 13-3/4 inches in diameter, can be used to hold various bartending accoutrements or to serve a round of martinis. Marquis makes matching martini glasses that echo the polka dot motif. In height, the shaker stands eight inches and the ice bucket seven inches. For best results, wash and dry the set by hand. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41A9PTVXK8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B00005RE4E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005RE4E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005RE4E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
