window.products.push({"id":289418,"name":"40 Balsam Sticks and Holder - Paine's Fir Balsam Incense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e2YHxn29L.jpg","description":"40 genuine 1.75\" BALSAM FIR INCENSE STICKS and a BURNER. Made in Maine since 1931, Paine's Balsam Fir Incense smells like the holidays—and for good reason. The company collects balsam branches from local woodsmen, then grinds, dries, and shapes those into sticks and cones that'll fill your home with the scent of evergreens, whether you have a real Christmas tree or not. Paine's incense is made in Auburn, Maine. First, balsam branches are brought to us by local woodsmen, where they are then ground and dried. It is next pressed into incense molds and finally dried… That’s it! No chemicals are added to our incense, and is 100% natural and sustainable!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e2YHxn29L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paine's","source_asin":"B00266WXGU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00266WXGU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00266WXGU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289419,"name":"Protein Shaker Bottle for Protein Mixes, 17 OZ, Leak Proof ● Easy Clean Up ● BPA Free, Tasteless, Safe Material ● No Blending Ball or Whisk Needed ● B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cdvzQQXoL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our bottles are presented in 6 beautiful different colors. A bottle can contain 17 oz / 500 ml in the main container and an additional 3 oz / 88.7 ml in each of the two small separate containers (which you can easily screw to the shaker bottle). Therefore, by purchasing this Shaker Bottle you can take with you both the fluid you intend to drink after your workout, and the amount of protein you intend to shake in it. The tightly threaded screw-on lid creates a leadproof seal. 3-in-1 Blender Bottle Pack: Designed with a standard protein shaker cup and two screw-on attachments, including a powder container and sectioned pill container, we’ve made storing proteins, vitamins, and supplements even easier on the go. Efficient Mixing: Stainless steel shaker bottles for protein mixes use a spiral spring stirrer, which can mix the protein shake faster than the stirring ball, so that it will not clump while shaking it will hit the bottom so that there is no more residue on the bottom. Portable non-slip and leak-proof: Our protein mixer bottle is suitable for most car cup holders and bicycle water bottle holders. It is convenient for you to carry around. The cup body has scale marks. In addition, the design of the flip cover is absolutely leak-proof, splash-proof and non-slip, the first choice for fitness outings. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee: If you have any problem with our Sports Shaker Water Bottle or questions, please kindly contact us for direction, exchange, refund or return.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cdvzQQXoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BDK1VRKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDK1VRKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDK1VRKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
