window.products.push({"id":289421,"name":"DreamHome 3 in 1 Soil Tester Tool – Analyses Moisture, Light Meter, pH Tester for Balanced Healthy Soil – Perfect for Indoor and Outdoor Plants (No Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cinSg-heL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Introducing the Soil Test Meter , brought to you by DreamHome , the easy way to keep your plants and flowers healthy and flourishing all year round.This handy gadget can help you accurately measure the correct pH level of your soil, its moisture content and light requirements that your plants need to keep healthy and in bloom. Advanced 3 in 1 Gardening Tool This easy to use Gardening Tool is a must-have item in your shed, with so many features in one simple gadget. This portable meter includes a sunlight analyser, a moisture detector, and a pH meter, all in one, keeping your plant’s soil and general environment at its optimum levels. Compact and Easy To Use In a world of complicated electronics, this is not one of them. This compact tool can be placed into the soil, and it does all of its calculations with expert accuracy. It requires no fiddly batteries – just plug it in and you’re good to go. Balanced Water and Sunlight As well as measuring your soil’s pH, one of the electrodes can measure the soil’s moisture, so that you never under or over water your plants or flowers. You’ll also find a light sensor that analyses the light intensity, and indicates whether you’re plant is receiving enough natural sunlight or not. Plant Tags Included Also included with your purchase are 6 plant tags that you can stake into the ground next to your plant. Each tag provides you with enough space to write down your observations, notes, reminders and information with the marker that is provided with each purchase. Makes Gardening A Breeze With this easy to use, compact Soil Test Meter by DreamHome, you’ll have a successful array of your favourite plants in your back garden, in your conservatory, or in your greenhouse. No more unexpected wilting or second-guessing with this excellent tool that every green-fingered plant owner must own. Don’t Delay and Buy Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cinSg-heL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DreamHome","source_asin":"B07FPXS5J5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FPXS5J5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FPXS5J5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289422,"name":"Juice Master Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319ih0FrRjL._AC_.jpg","description":"Super easy to use and easy to clean, the Juice Master juicer is the perfect fit for a first time user or someone looking for an upgrade. Easy, lightning-quick operation and simple clean-up. The 3.3\" Extra Wide Feed Chute processes whole fruits and vegetables without pre-cutting. Dual speed control lets you process leafy vegetables and soft fruit at the Low speed and harder fruits and vegetables at the High speed. User Friendly with an Easy Clean Design, a Safety Locking Arm and LED lights that let you know when all the parts are correctly in place. The Pulp Container has 2.2L worth of Jumbo Capacity and the Juice Jug w/ Froth Separator holds 1L of fresh juice. Both are dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. Get into the world of juicing with the no-nonsense, dual-speed Juice Master Pro Juicer. Drink to your health!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319ih0FrRjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Cesari Companies","source_asin":"B007WUOPUM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007WUOPUM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007WUOPUM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
