window.products.push({"id":289522,"name":"ZCDCP K Cup Holder Drawer, Coffee Pod Holder for K Cup Organizer, Keurig Coffee Pods Holder Capsule with 35 Pods, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ajLIbQ+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"35 PODS CAPACITY - Clearly distinguish your pods in flavor and colors by putting them in 5 columns. 7 k cup capsule pods holder can be organized in each column. Stores and organizes up to 35 keruig pods in neat rows, making selection fun and easy! STURDY METAL CONSTRUCTION - Made of heavy-duty metal to ensure stability to keep coffee maker from shifting and sliding. Solidly-built black powder-coated frame with the anti-scratch tabletop finish, four small non-slip fine felt bases to prevent scratching your table top. Easy-open sliding drawer with anti-derailed track and handle design, more convenient to pull and push. SPACE SAVING - Place your single-serve coffee machine on top of this coffee pod drawer to save valuable space on your countertop. Now you can keep your beverages close to your keurig coffee maker without taking up extra space. WIDE COMPATIBILITY - The size of the k cup holder drawer is about 16.14\"L * 11.42\"W * 3.46\"H. You can place keurig pod holder with different flavors to meet the needs of different moods. Also it can be a christmas gift for your lovers, family, friends and so on. AFTER-SALE AND WARRANTY - Excellent quality makes the product stable and durable. As an Amazon brand store, if you are not satisfied with the K-cup pod holder, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ajLIbQ+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZCDCP","source_asin":"B0BJDDY8KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJDDY8KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJDDY8KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
