window.products.push({"id":289710,"name":"wintefei Cartoon Animal Print Pillow Case Sofa Cushion Cover?for Bedroom Living Room Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HM8WysWKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specifications:Type: Pillow CaseMaterial: Polyester Peach SkinOccasions: Home, Office, Car, Cafe, etcFeatures: Cartoon Animal Pattern, Soft, Comfortable, Home DecorSize: 45cm x 45cm/17.72\" x 17.72\" (Approx.)Notes:The pattern is only on the front side.Due to the light and screen setting difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures.Please allow slight dimension difference due to different manual measurement.Package Includes:1 x Pillow Case (The pillow inner is not included.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HM8WysWKL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wintefei","source_asin":"B079SXR9Y3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079SXR9Y3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079SXR9Y3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289711,"name":"H&W Hindu Goddess Saraswati Idol, Orange Sarasvati Statue, Lmitation Glass Sculpture Buddha Figurine Decoration, Sitting on Lotus Sculpture Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZaIKWCcdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Saraswati, the goddess of knowledge and arts, represents the free flow of wisdom and consciousness. She is the mother of the vedas, and chants to her, called the 'saraswati\" often begin and end Vedic lessons. Saraswati is the daughter of Lord and Goddess durga. It is believed that goddess Saraswati endows human beings with the powers of speech, wisdom and learning. She has four hands representing four aspects of human personality in learning: mind, intellect, alertness and ego. She has sacred scriptures in one hand and a lotus – the symbol of true knowledge – in the second. With her other two hands she plays the music of love and life on a string instrument called theveena. She is dressed in white – the symbol of purity – and rides on a white swan – symbolizingSattwa Guna or purity and discrimination. Saraswati is also a prominent figure in Buddhist iconography - the consort of Manjushri. The learned and the erudite attach greater importance to the worship of goddess saraswati As a practice, only educated people worship her for knowledge and wisdom. They believe that only Saraswati can grant them 'moksha' - the final liberation of the soul. Saraswati's birthday - Vasant Panchami - is a Hindu festival celebrated every year on the 5th day of the bright fortnight of the lunar month of Magha. Hindus celebrate this festival with great fervor in temples, homes and educational institutes alike.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZaIKWCcdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&W","source_asin":"B0BNVZNBTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVZNBTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVZNBTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289712,"name":"Titanium Plated Chopstick Stainless Steel Chopsticks Metal Chopsticks Reusable Dishwasher safe Premium Laser Engraved Chop Sticks for Eating 2 Pairs G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I2fn6Ix4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our chopsticks are square metal chopsticks made of food-grade 304 stainless steel with permanent titanium plating&laser etching flower vine pattern body and nonslip line laser engraving tip. Why choose our chopsticks? ✿ Eco-Friendly and Durable The stainless steel chopsticks are very sturdy and durable. They can be used for 10 years or even longer. Usually, one pair of fiberglass chopsticks use for 1 year. One pair of wood chopsticks use for 3 months. One pair of disposable chopsticks use for once. Suppose one uses chopsticks twice a day, one pair of metal chopsticks equal to 10 pairs of plastic fiberglass chopsticks or 40 pairs of wood chopsticks or 7300 pairs of disposable chopsticks. Using metal chopsticks saves a lot of money and saves the earth from plastic/disposable chopsticks rubbish pollution. ✿ Titanium Plated Our metal chopsticks are made of food-grade 304 stainless steel with permanent titanium plating. The titanium plating is pretty and helps reduce the scratches. ✿ Anti-slip Design With upgrade line laser etching on the square chopsticks tip, our metal chopsticks are easier to grab and hold food than the round smooth metal chopsticks. ✿ Dishwasher Safe They are reusable chopsticks, dishwasher safe, easy clean, no worry of damage. ✿ Sanitary and Healthy The metal chopsticks are with smooth and hard surface. The bamboo chopsticks and wooden chopsticks get moldy easily as they gain food residue during use owning to their loose construction. The metal reusable chopsticks are free from the issue. ❥ Chopsticks Specification Chopsticks Length: 9 1/4 Inches (23.5cm) long Chopsticks Weight: 1.2 ounce (34g) per pair of metal chopsticks Chopsticks Material: 304(18/8) stainless steel with titanium plating Chopsticks Color: blue and silver ❥ Chopsticks Package 2 Pairs of metal chopsticks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I2fn6Ix4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greatamzor","source_asin":"B08H249HLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H249HLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H249HLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
