window.products.push({"id":289745,"name":"NOLTSE Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener, Chef's Best Choice, Best Kitchen Gadget for Arthritis, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61awl5-Ki-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HOW DO I OPEN THE BATTERY COMPARTMENT? Recently, we received a issue with our can openers where the battery cover is difficult to open. Here are some instructions for how to open these if you received one of the units: ☺STEP 1: Find the can opener's anti-slip edge. ☺STEP 2: Press the skid-proof edge on left side and push back gently. ☺STEP 3: Same operation on the right side. ☺STEP 4: Pull it back together and open it. At a Glance: ☇ Start and stop feature for hands-free opening ☇ Automatically open cans in seconds, operated by 2*AA batteries (Not Included) ☇ Sleek, low profile design for easy storage ☇ Hygienic - Cuts from side of can without leaving sharp edges, lid will never falls into can and touch on food ☇ Materials - ABS, TPE, Stainless Steel Operating the Can Opener ➷Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel ➷Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can ➷Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter ➷Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61awl5-Ki-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOLTSE","source_asin":"B09CTJM4FR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTJM4FR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTJM4FR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":289746,"name":"GROSCHE Milano Stove top espresso maker (3 espresso cup size 5 oz) Red, and battery operated milk frother bundle for lattes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rQwGl3AuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ [ Moka Espresso Coffee and Latte Kit ] Stovetop espresso maker, Moka pot, & manual coffee percolator machine. Available in 3 cups, 6 cups, 9 cup sizes. Stove top percolator coffee pot to make home espresso like a barista. Its easier to use than electric espresso coffee machines and makes a rich cup of espresso moka coffee. 3 cup expresso coffee maker stovetop size in Food grade anodized aluminium espresso Coffee maker. With the milk frother you can make Lattes. ⭐ [ Easy to use Moka Espresso coffee Maker & Cuban Coffee maker] will work on all gas and electric stove top and propane camping stoves as well. It makes moka coffee on glass top induction stoves but will heat very slowly since its not magnetic. It is a type of easy to use stovetop espresso maker, coffee perculator, or expresso coffee maker stovetop. Its also called a Moka pot, Moka coffe maker, or Cafetera Cubana. ⭐ [ Combine your moka coffee with rich milk froth to make Lattes easily at home ] You can easily make a moka latte coffee, by frothing 1% milk with the milk frother, and adding the moka coffee to it. ⭐ [ Easy to use battery operated milk frother with stainless steel frothing wand ] The GROSCHE EZ Latte milk frother has a stainless steel frothing wand which can be rinsed under running water after use. The frother uses 2x standard AA batteries (not included) and it has a high efficiency motor for battery saving technology to extend battery life. ⭐ [ Multi function milk frother for milk, egg whites, soups, dressings etc ] The EZ Latte milk frother is a multi function frother that can whish egg whites, salad dressings, and even be used as a matcha whisk. It is one of the most useful kitchen gadgets especially for true coffee lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rQwGl3AuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GROSCHE","source_asin":"B08KRGF7X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRGF7X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRGF7X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
