window.products.push({"id":289840,"name":"Yimobra Non Slip Bathtub Mat, Extra Long Bathroom Mat for Bath tub, Oversized Shower Floor Mats with Drain Holes, Machine Washable Bathroom Tub Mats w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eaR-pUVHL._AC_SL1474_.jpg","description":"Pvc Hundreds of Non-Slip Suction Cups & Strong Grip: Yimobra non-slip bath and shower mats feature 247 special big powerful tight suction cups. The different suction cups adsorption stronger than other small suction cup, that help hold in place on smooth, clean surfaces. Special Attention : Before put water, moisten the suction cup, then press hard at least 10 suction cups multiple times to ensure that it is firmly fixed on the bathtub More Coverage & 112 Big Drainage Holes: Yimobra extra long bathtub mat 39 x 16 inches and provides maximum coverage, oval upgrade design fits any size and shape bathtub or shower. The anti-slip mat is equipped with 112 big drainage holes provide fast water run -off, the mat does not float when bathtub is full of water. Accumulating soap and body wash will not remain, and the water will circulate rather than gather around the mat Machine Washable: Yimobra durable tub pad can be machine washed. Easy to clean, you can also throw the mat into the washing machine, do not need the machine to dry, place it in a dry and ventilated place, it will dry within a few minutes naturally. For better use, we recommend that after each bath, rinse with water then hang on the wall or bathtub side, prevent the growth of stain and odor-causing on the tub mat, also repels soap residues which can cause slipping Warning : Prevent Falls: Unpack, re-rolling mat on the reverse side in several times. Tub mat will only attach to clean, smooth surface. Not for use on textured, tiled, or non-smooth surfaces. Do not use bath oils and jump on the bath matmay cause slipping International products have separate terms, are sold from abroad and may differ from local products, including fit, age ratings, and language of product, labeling or instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eaR-pUVHL._AC_SL1474_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yimobra","source_asin":"B07TRKNJ6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TRKNJ6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TRKNJ6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
