window.products.push({"id":289973,"name":"Color G Black Kitchen Mat Long Runner Kitchen Floor Mats Cushioned Anti Fatigue, 17”x71” Foam Comfort Kitchen Padded Mats for Standing, Waterproof Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t1lKjGdqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【Cushioned and Anti fatigue】Color G kitchen cushioned floor mat is designed with foam to cushion our feet and the floor, whose adequate thickness and softness can disperse the force on our feet. If you want to relive your feet and legs quickly from pain and fatigue after a long day of running around at work, undoubtedly a soft and squishy anti fatigue mat is a good and sensible choice. You can also make it a good gift for your family or friends who are distressed with the same problem. 💦【Waterproof and Oil-proof】 This runner rugs for kitchen floor are made of premium PVC material, which has a good waterproof and oil-proof effect, so it is very easy to clean. Whether there is water stain, oil spot or food debris, the kitchen mat will be cleaned just by wiping it with a broom or mop. A floor mats for kitchen maybe can also protect your favorite tableware from breaking in some lucky moments. 🍀【Non-slip and Durability】 To prevent the kitchen standing mat from moving around, Color G kitchen floor mats non slip have an anti-slip design on the back to ensure the safety of you and your family. This mat for kitchen floor can be used on many surfaces, such as marble, wood, ceramic, laminate and concrete. It is important to ensure that the surface is dry and flat before use! 🏠【Perfect Decoration】Color G 0.4-inch rugs for kitchen floor is available in five popular colors. You can choose the long kitchen rug 17”x95\", 17”x71” or the shorter one 17”x47” according to your kitchen area, or you can combine them into sets to meet your needs. The kitchen floor mats for in front of sink also work perfectly in other places where you need to stand for a long time. The mat can make you stand comfortably When you are cooking meals washing dishes or folding laundry. 🌹【Words for You】 To prevent creases, our kitchen floor mat is packed rolled up. Don't worry if you find the kitchen rug runner a little out-of-flatness when it arrived, just put it flat and use it for a few days, the marks will fade away. Enjoy the beauty of life, start by putting the mat for your kitchen! If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t1lKjGdqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Color&Geometry","source_asin":"B09Z2RC8HX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-289973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2RC8HX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2RC8HX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
